cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use motifline, please cite it together with the tools it runs (see README)."
title: motifline
abstract: >-
  A Snakemake pipeline from model attributions to MoDISco motifs to FiNeMo hits,
  one line per run, for ChromBPNet and AlphaGenome on the same downstream code
  path, with pattern names assigned by TomTom against the HOCOMOCO/JASPAR union.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Wang
    given-names: Qiankang
    alias: wangkant
repository-code: "https://github.com/wangkant/motifline"
license: MIT
version: 0.1.0.dev0
keywords:
  - genomics
  - regulatory genomics
  - transcription factor motifs
  - chromatin accessibility
  - ChromBPNet
  - TF-MoDISco
  - Snakemake
